 load that file, ht9045_golden_kb.js retired

Both files hooked mousedown in the capture phase and both set window.HT9045GoldenKb (the later one won). motorB's rows are appended
before the last line of the unwired file (lines 1-235 unmoved; setupA's rows win when both define an id). Alert.Note, Cleaning,
OffSet, SetUp, Speed, Temp_Set, YieldMonitoring: only the script tag changes. Nothing else references the retired file.

Verified: syntax OK; headless Edge: Speed, Alert.Note, Contact, TrayForm, Temp_Set load with 0 JS errors (Contact's one 404 is the
GET-only stub server); the helper re-checked the 7 pages' keypad limits and setupA's TrayForm / Contact / DIO keypads.

